        "Warm afternoon sun, white rooftop, shallow depth of field, saturated colors, fisheye lens distortion. References: [1] the lead performer (character turnaround sheet: full body front, back and side views, face close-up front and side).Background reference: Miami rooftop patio, white concrete, blurred city buildings, warm afternoon sun, amber daylight tones.\n\nThe female stands center frame. She performs a low-knee bounce and points forcefully at the camera. She leans forward aggressively and says \"I am the hottest Chica on the earth, nobody can reach me\""
